WEBVTT

00:04:59.686 --> 00:05:04.000
wanaoishi kwenye nchi zenye kama watoto
wawili kwa mwanamke.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.538
(Makofi)

00:05:07.538 --> 00:05:11.498
Ni maendeleo ya kushangaza kabisa ambayo
yametokea.

00:05:11.498 --> 00:05:12.875
(Makofi)

00:05:12.875 --> 00:05:16.077
Na hizi ni nchi za Marekani hapa,

00:05:16.077 --> 00:05:18.238
zenye $40,000 kwa kila mtu,

00:05:18.238 --> 00:05:21.185
Ufaransa, Urusi, Uajemi,

00:05:21.185 --> 00:05:24.837
Mexico, Uturuki, Algeria,

00:05:24.837 --> 00:05:27.062
Indonesia, India

00:05:27.062 --> 00:05:29.791
na moja kwa moja mpaka Bangladesh na
Vietnam,

00:05:29.791 --> 00:05:33.834
ambazo zinazo chini ya asilimia tano ya
mapato kwa mtu wa Marekani